# Normalize line endings to LF for all text; let Git detect text vs binary.
#
# This alone is not enough: a file written with CRLF by a tool after checkout
# stays CRLF in the working copy, and anything measuring file content then gets
# a different answer locally than on a fresh LF checkout. That is how the skill
# front-matter budget in src/__tests__/mcp-payload.test.ts first failed on CI
# while passing here. That test now normalizes before it measures.
* text=auto eol=lf
bun.lock -diff linguist-generated=true
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.glb binary
*.webp binary
*.tgz binary
*.ico binary
